# Held at the C4 root with time stretching on and no stretch amount, so it plays unstretched. A pitch bend up moves the
# pitch off the speed, so the voice stretches and hops; bent back to centre the ratio is 1 again and the stretching
# ends, the note still held to the end of the render: the voice keeps its own cursor and closes its spare head's.
4608 90 3C 64
20000 E0 00 50
60000 E0 00 40
